meta {
  name: Admin
  seq: 19
}

docs {
  Admin dashboard API (docs/admin.md). Needs an admin or site admin account:
  set `adminLogin` and the secret `adminPassword` in the environment. Every
  request here is skipped when `adminLogin` is not set, so a full collection
  run with a regular account still passes.

  Run in order: Admin Login, List Users, Create User, Update User,
  Send Password Reset, Delete User. Create makes a throwaway account and
  Delete removes it again.
}
